  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only multiprofile models with scvi_n200 encoder (config_005, 0.65 accuracy) outperform singleprofile and PCA-based models. This experiment tests combining scvi_n200 (best RNA encoder) with resnet50 (strong image encoder) in a multimodal multiprofile setup using avgpool (proven effective in config_005) and concat fusion. It isolates the impact of multimodal integration while building on established effective components, balancing exploration of modality fusion with exploitation of prior successes."
}

